><draw name="LBText1"
><value
><text
>You must submit proposed labels, labeling, and advertisements sufficient to describe the device, its intended use, and the directions for its use. Where applicable, photographs or engineering drawings should be supplied (21 CFR 807.87(e)). We also strongly recommend you consult standard AAMI ANSI ES60601-1 Section 7 for applicable labeling that may be important for your device if it is electrical (consult ISO 14708-1 instead for implantable components).</text
></value
></draw
><instanceManager name="_GeneralLabeling"
/><subform name="GeneralLabeling" presence="visible"
/><instanceManager name="_Packaging"
